msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Go on, Thomas, you need your rest. There will be a lot more work in the coming days and weeks."
msgstr "Allez, Thomas, tu as besoin de repos. Il y aura bien plus de travail dans les jours et semaines à venir."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Thomas did not even protest, he simply turned around and left for his chambers."
msgstr "Thomas ne protesta même pas ; il se retourna tout simplement et partit vers ses appartements."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That's when Sarah knew her brother was truly exhausted."
msgstr "C’est alors que Sarah comprit que son frère était vraiment épuisé."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah scanned the great hall. There was nobody left that needed her attention. No more work to be done."
msgstr "Sarah balaya du regard la grande salle. Il ne restait plus personne nécessitant son attention. Plus aucun travail à faire."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Her eyes fell on her father's casket, now seemingly abandoned near the end of the hall."
msgstr "Ses yeux tombèrent sur le cercueil de son père, maintenant apparemment abandonné près du bout du hall."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Tomorrow the priests would render her father's body to the earth, placing him in the family grave, next to Mother."
