msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Freed from any hestitation, she found that the hesitant Jaeid had seemingly vanished."
msgstr "Libérée de toute hésitation, elle constata que le Jaeid hésitant semblait avoir disparu."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
