msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Only later, how much time Sarah could not recall, did her master finish just as she did for a third time."
msgstr "Ce n'est que plus tard, après un temps que Sarah ne pouvait plus mesurer, que son maître termina, pour la troisième fois, exactement comme elle l'avait fait."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt the surge of his seed, spewing deep in between her legs, filling her up."
