msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The big grin on his face, his bulky body, the easy stride of a man who didn't doubt himself."
msgstr "Le large sourire sur son visage, son corps massif, la démarche assurée d'un homme qui ne doutait pas de lui-même."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah had come to love all of it."
