msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "There was a beauty to Kate, but it seemed always mixed with something else."
msgstr "Il y avait une certaine beauté chez Kate, mais elle semblait toujours mêlée à quelque chose d'autre."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Outside, in the real world, it was worse. But in here, whenever it was just them, she seemed to drop her guard. Or at least, as much as Kate could ever drop her guard."
msgstr "Dehors, dans le monde réel, c'était encore pire. Mais ici, chaque fois qu'elles étaient seules, elle semblait baisser sa garde. Ou du moins, autant que Kate pouvait un jour baisser sa garde."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wish I'd fought harder to find you when you left."
msgstr "J'aurais dû me battre plus fort pour te retrouver quand tu es partie."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah could see the pain draw across Kate's face. Memories. Wounds. They were much the same to her."
