msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah heard the entrance to her tent rustle."
msgstr "Sarah entendit l'entrée de sa tente bruire."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Swiftly, she turned around. She had explicitely told the guards not to let anyone in."
msgstr "Vivement, elle se retourna. Elle avait explicitement dit aux gardes de ne laisser entrer personne."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw Samayra, entering the tent."
msgstr "Elle vit Samayra entrer dans la tente."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The moment their eyes met, Sarah saw Samayra become flustered."
msgstr "Dès que leurs regards se croisèrent, Sarah vit Samayra devenir toute émue."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I'm sorry, I just, I-"
