msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Well, I've got some things that can make time go by a whole lot more pleasant."
msgstr "Eh bien, j'ai quelques trucs qui pourraient rendre le temps bien plus agréable."

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "A shipment of Dreamstalk, came in just fresh off the boat."
msgstr "Une cargaison de Dreamstalk vient d'arriver, tout juste débarquée."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Dreamstalk?"
msgstr "Le Dreamstalk ?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah had never heard of it."
msgstr "Sarah n'en avait jamais entendu parler."

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "A plant root, if you burn it and inhale the vapors, it will make a day pass like a dream."
msgstr "Une racine de plante : si tu la brûles et que tu inspires les vapeurs, une journée passera comme un rêve."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Fuck, I'm bored enough to try anything. How much?"
