msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Free. Consider it a token of friendship."
msgstr "Gratuit. Considérez-le comme un gage d'amitié."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched his mirthless smile. Something in it...frightened her."
msgstr "Sarah observait son sourire sans joie. Quelque chose dedans... l'effrayait."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Consume Dreamstalk"
msgstr "Consommer la Tige de Rêve"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah reached out and eagerly took the dreamstalk from Hugh's hand."
msgstr "Sarah tendit la main et saisit avec empressement la tige de rêve dans la main de Hugh."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He smiled again."
msgstr "Il sourit à nouveau."

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "No worries. Hope this makes your stay a bit more pleasant here."
msgstr "Pas de souci. J'espère que ça rendra ton séjour ici un peu plus agréable."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He closed the door and left."
msgstr "Il referma la porte et partit."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah turned towards Alaric."
msgstr "Sarah se tourna vers Alaric."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You know this stuff?"
