msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Never before could she have imagined any feeling or sensation that could come close to this."
msgstr "Jamais auparavant elle n'aurait pu imaginer le moindre sentiment ou la moindre sensation capable de s'approcher de cela."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And she knew that she would give anything to remain here."
msgstr "Et elle savait qu'elle donnerait n'importe quoi pour rester ici."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For a moment, she was certain that this was what had been the purpose of her life."
msgstr "Pendant un instant, elle fut certaine que c'était là le but même de sa vie."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "To come here and experience this."
msgstr "Venir ici et vivre cela."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This single moment, utterly perfect."
