msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His feel, his touch, his smell, his sounds."
msgstr "Sa présence, son toucher, son odeur, les sons qu'il émettait."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She had never before experienced him, or anyone, so utterly."
msgstr "Elle ne l'avait jamais expérimenté ainsi, ni personne d'autre, de manière aussi totale."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah needed only to close her eyes, and she swore she could hear his thoughts."
msgstr "Sarah n'avait qu'à fermer les yeux, et elle jurait pouvoir entendre ses pensées."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "See herself, through his eyes, his burning and ravaging desire."
