msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It started with the old connections that visited their wedding."
msgstr "Cela a commencé avec les anciennes relations qui avaient assisté à leur mariage."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Taking out loans, he agressively began to buy up the free land in and around the town."
